A new Adeos snapshot is available at
http://savannah.nongnu.org/download/adeos/snapshots/adeos-20020918.tar.gz

It includes:

- a new candidate patch (r4c2) against the Linux 2.4 branch (available
for 2.4.19).
- a new candidate patch (r1c3) against the Linux 2.5 branch (available
for 2.5.31).

Most of the work carried out since the last snapshot was aimed at
adding support for the 2.5 branch. Additionally, a general event
notification system has been introduced so that intercepting system
events and exceptions generated by domains is now possible through a
unified interface. This mecanism is described in the on-line API
documentation at
http://www.freesoftware.fsf.org/adeos/doc/api/interface_8h.html#a25.

